{"speciesId":510,"names":{"fr":"Léopardus","es":"Liepard","en":"Liepard","ja":"レパルダス"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Un Pokémon insaisissable. Son style et son pelage magnifique attirent de nombreux Dresseurs."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"These Pokémon vanish and appear unexpectedly. Many Trainers are drawn to their beautiful form and fur."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il s’approche sans un bruit de sa proie et l’abat d’un coup par derrière sans jamais être repéré."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Stealthily, it sneaks up on its target, striking from behind before its victim has a chance to react."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Their beautiful form comes from the muscles they have developed. They run silently in the night."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Their beautiful form comes from the muscles they have developed. They run silently in the night."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Sa ligne élégante cache une musculature féline qui lui permet de surprendre lors de ses attaques nocturnes."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Su bella y grácil silueta le viene dada por su desarrollada musculatura, que le permite andar de noche sin hacer ruido."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Their beautiful form comes from the muscles they have developed. They run silently in the night."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"美しい スタイルは 全身の 発達した 筋肉の おかげ。 音もたてずに 夜を 駆けぬける。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il s’approche sans un bruit de sa proie et l’abat d’un coup par-derrière sans jamais être repéré."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Se aproxima evitando que lo detecten. Con sigilo, se acerca a su rival por la espalda y lo ataca."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Stealthily, it sneaks up on its target, striking from behind before its victim has a chance to react."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"気配を 殺して 接近する。 相手が 気づく 前に 背後から 忍び寄り しとめて